# Nothing is plugged in (a volunteer who has not attached a counter yet), a week of it, with two serial ports of other devices
# that never answer. The monitor looks every 15 s (the Yarrow ports, the Radioactive@Home HID device, then <GETVER>> to every
# serial port at two baud rates), waits in 500 ms steps between looks, and after 5 minutes asks for a temporary exit of 30
# minutes. Under BOINC the process is gone during the exit; the simulation moves the clock instead.
source none
interval 600
hours 168
cpm 20
seed 1
foreign_ports 2
